+	CHANGED (Phase 2a remodel): every part was remodelled for a hand-built look in one design language:
+	off-white hull panels, charcoal structure, a little safety orange and hazard yellow, brushed metal for
+	engines and mechanisms. Curves (cones, ogives, domes, bells) are lathed from many thin slices that follow a
+	real profile curve; every stackable part carries the same thin dark collar on its mating faces so stacked
+	rockets line up; engine bells end in a hollow skirt of staves you can look into from below. Only Block,
+	Cylinder, Ball and WedgePart primitives are used (server-built crafts must replicate).
+
 	build(def, mode) returns a NEW Model in PART-LOCAL space:
